      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "HOUSE OF SINS (5) was a last start winner (37.79) from Box 4 at this track. Yet to taste defeat from two runs out of this box. Can continue on his winning ways. SHADE OF PALE (3) was sent out long odds last time but rocketed out of the boxes with a fast early sectional and gave a sight before being swallowed up late, finishing a 3.5 lengths second (38.03) over 660m at this track. Although beaten ran one of the quickest times on the card last start. Likely to be in the finish again. PAW QUINBY (1) produced a moderate effort last time when sixth at this track over 660m behind HOUSE OF SINS (38.22) in a Mix 4/5 H. Was in the money the start prior. Has ability and a bold showing is expected. EXCLUSIVELY (2) was below best last time at this track (38.30) in a Mix 4/5 H, finishing a 7 length seventh. Has an unbeaten record from this draw, scoring two times.",
